      "title": "Balxning olinishi",
      "place": "Balx",
      "coords": [
        36.76,
        66.9
      ],
      "summary": "Amir Temur Amir Husaynga qarshi kurashda g‘alaba qozonib, Movarounnahrda hokimiyatni qo‘lga oldi.",
      "detail": "1370-yilda Balx qamali va Amir Husaynning mag‘lub bo‘lishi Amir Temurning yakkahokimligiga yo‘l ochdi. Samarqand davlat markaziga aylandi.",
      "source": "https://www.britannica.com/biography/Timur"
    },
    {
      "id": "t-herat",
      "year": 1381,
      "title": "Hirotning bo‘ysundirilishi",
      "place": "Hirot",
      "coords": [
        34.35,
        62.2
      ],
      "summary": "Xurosonning muhim markazi Hirot Amir Temur hokimiyatiga o‘tdi.",
      "detail": "Hirot (Kartlar sulolasi) 1381-yilda taslim bo‘ldi. Bu Eron sari yurishlarning boshlanishi bo‘ldi.",
      "source": "https://www.britannica.com/biography/Timur"
    },
    {
      "id": "t-isfahan",
