      "title": "Isfahon yurishi",
      "place": "Isfahon",
      "coords": [
        32.65,
        51.67
      ],
      "summary": "Fors va Eron markaziy shaharlari bo‘ysundirildi.",
      "detail": "1387-yildagi Isfahon voqealari Eron yurishlarining eng og‘ir sahifalaridan biri bo‘ldi.",
      "source": "https://www.britannica.com/biography/Timur"
    },
    {
      "id": "t-kondurcha",
      "year": 1391,
      "title": "Kondurcha daryosi jangi",
      "place": "Volga bo‘yi (taxminiy)",
      "coords": [
        53.0,
        50.0
      ],
      "summary": "Oltin O‘rda xoni Toxtamishga qarshi katta g‘alaba.",
      "detail": "1391-yilda Amir Temur Toxtamish qo‘shinini mag‘lub etdi. Jang o‘rnining aniq koordinatasi manbalarda turlicha.",
      "source": "https://www.britannica.com/biography/Timur"
    },
    {
      "id": "t-terek",
      "year": 1395,
      "title": "Terek daryosi jangi",
      "place": "Shimoliy Kavkaz",
      "coords": [
        43.6,
        45.7
      ],
      "summary": "Toxtamish bilan ikkinchi hal qiluvchi jang, Oltin O‘rda kuchi sindirildi.",
      "detail": "1395-yilgi jangdan so‘ng Oltin O‘rda markazlari zarbaga uchradi va Amir Temur Kavkaz hamda Volga bo‘yida ustunlik oldi.",
      "source": "https://www.britannica.com/biography/Timur"
    },
    {
      "id": "t-delhi",
